{"date": "2015-11-18", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/1118.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:13:20+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "8e970f8fe6b6f901d38aa432b2297dac122f6a53928b2bd992ba303b481cc8e3", "image_bytes": 74348, "last_modified": "Wed, 14 Sep 2016 16:39:05 GMT", "title": "宜梦想", "title_kind": "宜", "source": null, "author": "弗朗索瓦丝．萨冈", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": ["source_not_detected"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "所有漂泊的人生都梦想着平静、童年、杜鹃花，正如所有平静的人生都幻想伏特加、乐队和醉生梦死。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
{"date": "2015-11-19", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/1119.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:13:20+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "7e846da808752ba745cccf06987e06b80a98490fd4028cce0a0bbc132c05727a", "image_bytes": 89491, "last_modified": "Wed, 14 Sep 2016 16:39:17 GMT", "title": "宜自我追寻", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "德米安", "author": "赫尔曼．黑塞", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "对每个人而言，真正的职责只有一个：找到自我。然后在心中坚守其一生，全心全意，永不停息。所有其他的路都是不完整的，是人的逃避方式，是对大众理想的怯懦回归，是随波逐流，是对内心的恐惧。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1}
{"date": "2015-11-20", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/1120.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:13:20+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "92737bd0071886e745c7b93776bd8921148c92a6f2250596ec81249902a0835f", "image_bytes": 70174, "last_modified": "Wed, 14 Sep 2016 16:39:20 GMT", "title": "宜改变", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "安娜·卡列尼娜", "author": "托尔斯泰", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "每个人都想要改变世界，却没人想过要改变自己。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1}
{"date": "2015-11-21", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2015/1121.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:13:21+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "265f97346ca9f061968661b79cd9dd14061a1e9b36dca840ced9e106e1b250f2", "image_bytes": 82613, "last_modified": "Wed, 14 Sep 2016 16:39:26 GMT", "title": "宜勇敢", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "布登勃洛克一家", "author": "托马斯．曼", "author_roles": [], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.3, "review_flags": ["low_ocr_confidence"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "在这样的年龄，生活还没有撞疼我们，责任感和悔恨也还都不敢损伤我们，那时我们还敢于看，敢于听，敢于笑，敢于惊讶，也敢于做梦，然而另一方面世界却还不曾向我们提出什么要求⋯⋯", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5}
